/extras/download.gif?t=1743811938\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo concludes after many twists and turns with a showdown with a gang of wraiths in the Domed Room:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431270/extras/dr_ending.png?t=1743811938\" /></p>","developers":["Castlelore Studios LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3423010","name":"Xoru: The Nightmare Wars"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431270/ba230d633416dccfb5e7ded2cac071257cb9ff26/header.jpg?t=1743811938","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit Intel-compatible CPU or Apple Silicon using Rosetta 2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119013,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119013/movie480.mp4?t=1743811937","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119013/movie_max.mp4?t=1743811937"},"name":"Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119013/daa7789c44cc84955100c928f3ce4790ecf25488/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743811937","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119013/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743811937","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119013/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743811937"}}],"name":"Xoru: The Nightmare Wars Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz 64-bit GPU (or compatible)<br></li><li>